## Check in the stored procedure
- `@Location_Function_Id` is set by the SELECT that runs before `TRY_PROC` and has no `LIMIT 1`. If more than one row matches the proc name, MySQL will error. A `LIMIT 1` there would be safer.
- Using `@Valid` and `@Granted` as session variables is the same pattern as your other procs.
